        "",
        "The webhook signature base string is:",
        "",
        "```text",
        "X-Clink-Timestamp + \".\" + raw request body",
        "```",
        "",
        "Verify the HMAC SHA-256 hex digest with `CLINK_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_KEY` and reject timestamps outside the 300-second freshness window before parsing JSON.",
        "Only after verification should the handler call JSON parsing and normalize legacy payloads. Unknown payloads or event types must return non-2xx and enter the application's Inbox/retry path.",
        "The freshness window does not replace idempotency: durably claim each `event.id` before applying side effects so valid retries cannot be processed twice.",
        "",
        "For a complete commerce integration, register the endpoint with the runtime-validated commerce preset:",
